### Through the api-gateway: the one door clients (SkillForge's server) use.
### Locally it runs on 8080; if another program uses 8080, start it with SERVER_PORT=8090.
### With GATEWAY_API_KEY set, every request needs X-Api-Key (locally e.g. GATEWAY_API_KEY=local-dev-key).
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@key = local-dev-key

### Events through the gateway (the response carries an X-Correlation-Id)
GET {{gateway}}/events
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Book with your own correlation id, then find it in the logs of all three services
POST {{gateway}}/events/cloud-iasi/bookings
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-trace-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@example.com", "seats": 1}

### One customer's notifications
GET {{gateway}}/notifications?customerEmail=ana@example.com
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Without the key: 401 ProblemDetail
GET {{gateway}}/events

### Health: no key needed (Docker and Cloud Run check it)
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health
